//     trigger: unbounded `Int` ladder + BigInt alignment decision.
//   - `type TsString = String` — UTF-16 code units vs std/text `String`
//     refinement — owner: std/text.dag + disposition policy (rust char/str
//     precedent).
//   - `symbol` / `null` / `undefined` — LanguageModel + nominal/runtime
//     substrate; outside this D2 slice.


